title: Genetic Correlation Browser (UK Biobank LDSC)
message: >-
  If you use this tool, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Duncan
    family-names: Palmer
    affiliation: Broad Institute of MIT and Harvard
  - given-names: Nikolas
    family-names: Baya
    affiliation: Broad Institute of MIT and Harvard
  - given-names: Benjamin
    family-names: Neale
    affiliation: Broad Institute of MIT and Harvard
repository-code: https://github.com/nikbaya/rg_browser
url: https://nikbaya.github.io/rg_browser/
abstract: >-
  An interactive browser of UK Biobank LDSC genetic correlations across
  heritable phenotypes, visualizing publicly released summary statistics from
  the Neale lab UKBB LDSC r2 project (UK Biobank Resource, Application Number
  31063). The original UK Biobank rg browser was built by Duncan Palmer; this
  version was created by Nikolas Baya with Claude Code.
license: MIT
